author: codex-sol
resolution: "Reverified main eebda9277e52 (unchanged since audit): Published caller templates no longer contain placeholders, and the canonical pm-graph/pm-jira/pm-todos checkouts now have SHA-pinned gated callers. The adoption request is delivered, though the old pinned workflows can fail later. Retained evidence: docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml."
