comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T09:25:31.280Z",codex-sol,"The caller example intentionally uses release commit and exact version placeholders. The currently published extension predates the gate, and this work is authorized only in the pm-github worktree. No pilot workflow in another repository was changed, enabled, or dispatched. Resolve the placeholders only after a reviewed release and separately authorized caller adoption."
  "2026-10-17T00:39:26.413Z",codex-agent,"Additional release-adoption dependency from pm-github-c093: the default-branch pm-github-sync callers in pm-beads, pm-brief, pm-context, pm-csv, pm-linear and pm-slack-standup all pin workflow SHA 67a5e3e1514fddeeae29951da00513f06f7aa0ab and pm-github-version 2026.10.16. Regeneration with the import-fidelity fix requires adoption of its reviewed release in both pins; the next scheduled sync using that release can then regenerate the existing sync PRs. Keep rollout as separately authorized work; the import-fidelity task does not change or dispatch consumer workflows."
  "2026-10-18T04:25:11.088Z",codex-agent,"Remaining rollout follow-up for pm-github-8r7c: GitHub excludes workflow_dispatch job checks from PR branch rules. After the reviewed provider release, authorize one-time caller App client-ID/private-key mapping for eligible native PR runs, add CodeQL workflow_dispatch for additional head verification, remove or expand explicit closeout ci.yml overrides, and declare required-checks per current protection policy. docs/bot-pr-automation.md lists all 24 callers and contexts. Preserve existing disabled pilot states until separately authorized; this task inspected callers read-only and did not change, enable or dispatch them."
  "2026-10-21T18:43:15.541Z",codex-agent,"Reverified main eebda9277e52 (unchanged since audit): Published caller templates no longer contain placeholders, and the canonical pm-graph/pm-jira/pm-todos checkouts now have SHA-pinned gated callers. The adoption request is delivered, though the old pinned workflows can fail later. Retained evidence: docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml."
